            " / " +
            max +
            " bytes). Crash-resume may stop working before the run ends. The log dump is " +
            "unaffected — call dumpTemplates() early and often to be safe."
        )
      }
    }
  } catch (e) {
    // Size reporting is advisory; never let it break a capture.
  }
}

